OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured after targeted
OL,4,Afirearms incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been arrested after
OL,7,Fthree people were injured during a
OL,8,Ftargeted firearms incident, police
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FEssex Police was called to an incident
OL,12,Fin Market Place, Braintree, at about
OL,13,F22:10 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FThree people were taken to hospital
OL,16,Fwith what were believed to be non-life
OL,17,F-threatening injuries, Essex Police
OL,18,Fsaid.
